    "text": "Parkersburg News & Sentinel\nwebsite\nWood County, West Virginia\nMid-Ohio Valley Regional Health Department hosts discussion on responses to public health emergencies\n19 minutes ago\nPARKERSBURG — The Mid-Ohio Valley Regional Health Department held a tabletop session at the Wood County Resiliency Center on Wednesday. Representatives from Wood, Pleasants, Ritchie, Roane, Wirt, and Calhoun county health departments came together to discuss scenarios and responses for public health emergencies. The tabletop exercise discussed H5N1 scenarios...",
